Idea Base: I was curious if I could improve the look of flames in various torches without using high-res assets - I wanted to preserve the vanilla aesthetic.

A collection of torches, braziers and firesticks from Doom clones with (IMO) improved animation of the flame, dynamic lights and ambient sound for better atmosphere.